{
    "_comment": [
        "Frontend-local settings schema. Deliberately the SAME shape as the schema the",
        "backend serves over CONFIG_SCHEMA (0x91), so SettingsView renders local and",
        "remote settings through one delegate family and adding a setting is one entry",
        "here plus one binding in app/Theme.qml.",
        "",
        "Per-group keys: id, label, icon (a semantic name mapped to a resource by",
        "SettingsSidebar, not a file path), settings.",
        "",
        "Per-setting keys: key, type (bool|int|float|string|enum|action), label, help,",
        "unit,",
        "min/max/step (numeric), options (enum), default, apply, editor.",
        "editor: numeric settings get a [-] value [+] stepper by default; set",
        "        'slider' only for coarse dials where the exact number does not",
        "",
        "type 'action' is a BUTTON, not a value: nothing is stored or persisted.",
        "It carries actionLabel and optionally requiresConnection, and its key names",
        "a handler in Settings::invokeAction.",
        "        matter (a 65534-step slider is unusable, see SettingNumber).",
        "min/max/step (numeric), options (enum), default, apply.",
        "apply: 'live'    - a QML binding through Theme picks it up immediately;",
        "       'restart' - consumed once at startup (AppConfig), so it needs an app",
        "                   restart. The view badges these rows.",
        "",
        "A setting may also declare 'env': the named environment variable (or .env",
        "entry) supplies that setting's DEFAULT, so an existing deployment keeps",
        "working until the user overrides it here. Precedence: schema default <",
        "env/.env < saved user override.",
        "",
        "Values the user changes are written to settings.json under the platform's",
        "AppConfigLocation (see core/settings.cpp) - never back into this bundled file,",
        "which is compiled into the binary and supplies only the defaults."
    ],
    "groups": [
        {
            "id": "app",
            "icon": "app",
            "label": "Sovellus",
            "settings": [
                {
                    "key": "lunaEnabled",
                    "type": "bool",
                    "label": "Luna",
                    "help": "Koiramuistomerkki kulkee työpöydän alalaidassa.",
                    "default": false,
                    "apply": "live"
                },
                {
                    "key": "screensaverEnabled",
                    "type": "bool",
                    "label": "Näytönsäästäjä",
                    "help": "Kuvaesitys, kun näyttöä ei ole koskettu hetkeen.",
                    "default": true,
                    "apply": "live"
                },
                {
                    "key": "screensaverTimeoutMin",
                    "type": "int",
                    "env": "TESLA_HOMEDASH_SCREENSAVER_TIMEOUT_MIN",
                    "label": "Käynnistysviive",
                    "help": "Kuinka kauan kosketuksetta ennen näytönsäästäjää.",
                    "unit": "min",
                    "min": 1,
                    "max": 240,
                    "step": 1,
                    "default": 30,
                    "apply": "live"
                },
                {
                    "key": "screensaverAdvanceSec",
                    "type": "int",
                    "label": "Kuvan vaihtoväli",
                    "unit": "s",
                    "min": 2,
                    "max": 120,
                    "step": 1,
                    "default": 8,
                    "apply": "live"
                },
                {
                    "key": "screensaverStackCount",
                    "editor": "slider",
                    "type": "int",
                    "label": "Kuvapinon koko",
                    "help": "Montako kuvaa pinossa näkyy kerrallaan.",
                    "min": 3,
                    "max": 30,
                    "step": 1,
                    "default": 10,
                    "apply": "live"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "graphs",
            "icon": "chart",
            "label": "Graafit",
            "settings": [
                {
                    "key": "tripMaxSpeedKmh",
                    "editor": "slider",
                    "type": "float",
                    "label": "Reittivärin huippunopeus",
                    "help": "Nopeus, jolla matkan reittiviiva on täysin punainen.",
                    "unit": "km/h",
                    "min": 50.0,
                    "max": 250.0,
                    "step": 5.0,
                    "default": 150.0,
                    "apply": "live"
                },
                {
                    "key": "graphBucketsPerPx",
                    "editor": "slider",
                    "type": "float",
                    "label": "Piirtotarkkuus",
                    "help": "Pisteitä kuvapistettä kohden. Pienempi = kevyempi, karkeampi.",
